/// QoS policy
pub struct QosPolicy {
  /// 5G QoS Flow Indicator value. The 5QI identifies a specific QoS forwarding treatment to be provided to a flow. See 3GPP TS23.501 section 192.0.2.1 for a full description of the 5QI parameter, and table 5.7.4-1 for the definition the 5QI values.
